---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-rule/10 bg-ink text-paper">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-lg">Paralegal Portfolio</p>
      <p class="text-paper/60 mt-1">
        Demonstrating 28 paralegal task types through 6 fictional California cases.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Get in touch</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-paper/80 hover:text-accent-3 underline">
        Contact
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-paper/50 text-xs">
      <p class="font-semibold text-paper/80 mb-2">Disclaimer</p>
      <p>
        All cases, parties, and documents on this site are fictional and were
        created solely to demonstrate paralegal work product. Nothing on this
        site is legal advice.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">© {year} Top Virtual PH</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
